(text "== U2 ISL9241: 3S NVDC charger and system supply ==" (at 849.63 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 773e20f3-0018-54c4-a309-3d514c2d715b))
(text "Charge current and VSYSMIN power up at zero. Check JEITA, 3S strap, current limits and throttle before releasing the hardware gates." (at 849.63 750.57 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid aae9dc38-5635-514c-aacb-8b98c23a7af8))
(text "Q25 is the NVDC battery FET. Shutdown disables the loads; this FET alone does not provide complete pack isolation." (at 849.63 758.19 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid b9d843b2-b6f4-5a3c-bb30-e28ccfee5bab))
(text "== source-control interlocks ==" (at 1200.15 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid b9243eca-ce7d-5660-a8c2-c9cb3900ca67))
(text "A low bias indication means REGN is below about 2V, beneath the charger reset threshold. Wait for detector startup before using it." (at 1200.15 410.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid d33cbdc6-05ac-5bb5-80e4-ee41803a8330))
(text "A powered charger must acknowledge a low input limit before any source is enabled. An I2C failure alone is not proof of reset." (at 1200.15 420.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 960e707b-eea0-5671-8323-8cbdd2e5c4a2))
(text "== always-on supply: low-loss USB feeds and shared protection ==" (at 650.24 289.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid e8cf2acb-dd4b-52db-ae97-123c7aaca3d7))
(text "U718 provides fast voltage protection. U2660 controls inrush and latches a sustained overcurrent. Both start without the EC." (at 650.24 684.53 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 6f1f31d9-324c-57a1-a793-7b5f2458ee3f))
(text "Raw USB/AUX can start the EC before source selection. VSYS supplies standby from the adapter or protected pack." (at 650.24 815.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 85bc617b-cc79-5a5b-8dd1-024dc9a4173c))
(text "== U2660 standby current limit and service reset ==" (at 849.63 810.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 33df20c7-be83-5ad5-8e2b-34cd06899729))
(text "The combined sense resistance is 90mOhm. Kelvin-route IN and SENSE to the resistor pair; no load copper in the pickups." (at 849.63 1029.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 59b7e918-4289-535f-8334-6e5f8d47135d))
(text "U718 supplies the fast UV/OV protection. U2660 UV/OV inputs are disabled; its current limiter and timer remain active." (at 849.63 1040.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 3bf39f54-4551-54fe-988a-6f8ff500e867))
(text "After fixing a standby short, remove all power or momentarily short TP2660 to TP2661 to reset the latch. This also restarts the EC." (at 849.63 1050.29 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid a328f295-514f-5a90-a2ac-1512f952aa19))
